@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+.. change::
+    :tags: bug, mysql
+    :tickets: 7281
+    :versions: 2.0.0b1
+
+    Fixed issue in MySQL :meth:`_mysql.Insert.on_duplicate_key_update` which
+    would render the wrong column name when an expression were used in a VALUES
+    expression. Pull request courtesy Cristian Sabaila.
